---
import BetaSignupForm from "./BetaSignupForm.astro";
---

<section
	class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center"
>
	<div
		class="absolute -top-1/3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[900px] h-[900px] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-30 pointer-events-none"
		style="background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-brand) 0%, transparent 60%);"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
	</div>

	<div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
		<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
			<span
				class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl font-display font-extrabold text-xl text-white"
				style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-brand), var(--color-brand-deep)); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -4px var(--color-brand-glow);"
			>
				C
			</span>
			<span
				class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight font-[var(--font-display)]"
			>
				Completr
			</span>
		</div>

		<span
			class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--color-brand)]/15 text-[var(--color-brand)] border border-[var(--color-brand)]/30"
		>
			<span
				class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-brand)] animate-pulse"
			></span>
			Beta cerrada
		</span>

		<h1
			class="font-[var(--font-display)] m-0 text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]"
		>
			Estamos afinando los
			<span
				class="bg-clip-text text-transparent"
				style="background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-brand), #c4a8ff);"
				>últimos detalles</span
			>.
		</h1>

		<p
			class="m-0 text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--color-fg-secondary)] leading-relaxed max-w-xl"
		>
			Tu backlog crece más rápido que tu tiempo libre. Completr ordena lo
			que tienes pendiente y te dice qué vale la pena jugar a
			continuación. Déjame tu correo y te aviso en cuanto abramos cupos de
			la
			<strong class="text-[var(--color-fg)]">beta cerrada</strong>.
		</p>

		<div class="w-full">
			<BetaSignupForm />
		</div>
	</div>

	<a
		href="#features"
		class="absolute bottom-10 z-10 text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand)] transition-colors flex flex-col items-center gap-1 no-underline"
		aria-label="Ver más"
	>
		<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Conocer más</span>
		<svg
			xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
			width="20"
			height="20"
			viewBox="0 0 24 24"
			fill="none"
			stroke="currentColor"
			stroke-width="2"
			stroke-linecap="round"
			stroke-linejoin="round"
			class="animate-bounce"
		>
			<polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
		</svg>
	</a>
</section>
